--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Each of the three MIT ports above carries the same changes as Tokyo Night:
renamed, the pi thinking ramp rebuilt from its own signature hue, `bashMode`
repointed to a warmer colour from the same palette so it stops colliding with
`success`, and the pi/Prime background roles listed above given dedicated
surfaces. No syntax or interface colour was altered in any of them, and every
value used is the upstream palette's own.

archive/themes/pi/ocaso.json has no upstream that could be identified and appears to be
original work.
